# ACCEPTANCE: cu-007

T007.1 A per-CU lead that writes a path on its CU no-touch list fails the wave with rule lead.
T007.2 A wave lead that writes a path on the no-touch list of a CU it was not asked to repair fails the wave with rule lead.
T007.3 The dirty baseline is recomputed per wave, excludes paths this run wrote, and includes untracked files.
T007.4 Escalated CUs are read from the feedback folder and excluded from the wave lead guard set.
